      "deploy": "lands folded on its belly: legs swing out and stand it up (by 0.6 s), then the mast rises and the bubble grows to 4 m (the power_on motion from 0.6 s)",
      "idle": "loop: lower ring 1 turn anticlockwise, upper ring 2 turns clockwise and the core 1 turn (seen from above) per 3 s; play it at a speed ramped 0-1 to spin up and down",
      "power_on": "standing with the mast down: mast rises, bubble grows over 0.45-0.95 s (legs and body held standing)",
      "power_off": "switched off or battery empty: bubble collapses in 0.25 s, mast sinks (legs and body held standing)",
      "shutdown": "shot: bubble collapses in 0.12 s, the legs give way and it sags; keys only body, legs and bubble, so play power_off at 2.5x with it if the mast was up"
